Actions: 3-hit light combo (attack1 → attack2 → attack3, 32 / 38 / 54 base damage) with input buffering past 35% swing progress, heavy (68 dmg, 24 poise), [Q]/[E] 360° cast (88 dmg, 30 poise, 4.5s cooldown, 0.36s i-frames), dodge (24 stamina, 0.28s i-frames), and block (Shift/L).
Deflect / Parry: Pressing block within 0.26s before a parryable strike triggers a DEFLECT, negating all damage, restoring +25 stamina, dealing +46 poise to Dundubhi, and triggering hitstop + clash flare. Standard blocking absorbs 65% of damage at the cost of 22 stamina.
Dundubhi Boss AI (900 HP, 100 Max Poise):
Moveset: punch (chains into swipe/slam), swipe, slam (leaps onto target and crushes nearby pillars for 110 self-damage + 58 poise), roar (unparryable 5.4-radius shockwave), and charge (bull-rush; baiting him into an intact pillar deals 120 damage and triggers an immediate 2.6s stagger where Rudra deals 1.65x damage).
