Combat Juice: Hitstop freeze frames (hitstopTimer), quadratic cameraTrauma applied via CSS translate3d on shakeWrapperRef (so the <video> backdrop and 3D WebGL canvas shake in lockstep), and impactFrame flashes.
3. 3D Pipeline, Shaders & VFX Architecture
Perspective-Matched Composite (KaalyugaStage.tsx):
computeCoverMatchedFov dynamically adjusts vertical FOV when the viewport is wider than 16:9 so the 3D WebGL ground plane stays locked to the object-cover <video> courtyard (BASE_VERTICAL_FOV = 30.0), with subtle FOV zoom pulses on impacts/casts.
Includes detectSoftwareWebGL() so software renderers (SwiftShader/llvmpipe) drop shadows/antialiasing and pace frames via gl.fenceSync + setTimeout(..., 80) instead of requestAnimationFrame.
Cel-Shading & Sumi-e Outlines (demonSlayerShader.ts):
liftTextureToAnimeVibrancy runs a 2D canvas pass on diffuse textures to deepen dark ink crevices (luma < 0.08) while gamma-lifting (pow(c, 0.76)) and saturating midtones.
createDemonSlayerCelMaterial injects a hard-stepped Fresnel rim light (smoothstep(0.32, 0.56, pow(1 - NdotV, uRimPower))) and hit-flash color mix into THREE.MeshToonMaterial.
attachSumiInkOutlines clones each SkinnedMesh / Mesh as a BackSide ink hull extruded along vertex normals proportionally to local bounding span.
FBX Rig Processing (assetLoader.ts):
Transfers UVs 1:1 from textured.fbx to rigged.fbx when vertex counts match (e.g., Bellhorn's 839,544 vertices), then runs simplifyGeometryPreserveSkin (spatial grid vertex welding down to ~26k triangles) while preserving skinIndex and skinWeight.
Normalizes Mixamo/Meshy hip translation, trims attack animations to crisp strike windows (trimClipWindow), smooths loop seams (smoothLoopSeam), poses into idle before scaling to 1.46m (Rudra) and 2.18m (Dundubhi), and clamps foot bones to Y = 0 every frame via getMinFootWorldY.
Mounts the Parashu axe onto Rudra's RightHand bone with bladeBaseNode / bladeTipNode anchors and a dual-crossed animated noise-flame weaponAuraMat sheath.
